anager, and never embed them in client-side code, mobile apps, or other untrusted contexts.\\n\",\"scheme\":\"bearer\",\"type\":\"http\"},\"bearerAuth\":{\"description\":\"API key passed as a Bearer token\",\"scheme\":\"bearer\",\"type\":\"http\"}},\"securitySource\":\"operation\"}"
